  <item>
    <title>14. 喂饱自己的不是快手菜，而是不放弃的生活力</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680267601f1db84a562bdf11</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680267601f1db84a562bdf11</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Apr 2025 15:01:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>快手菜是打工人的生存战。空气炸锅是神器吗？冰箱里的冻豌豆还能抢救吗？预制菜是天堂还是地狱？我们有好多懒人做饭经验想要分享。一起来听听这场关于厨房热气腾腾的讨论吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：七七 果冻 皮蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：果冻</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">00:01:46</a> 定义快手菜：不只是水煮凉拌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">00:02:32</a> 懒人厨具红黑榜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">00:25:54</a> 冰箱边角料改造指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1907">00:31:47</a> 创意快手菜安利</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4325">01:12:05</a> 深夜食堂灵感特辑</span></p>]]></description>
