  <item>
    <title>13. 韩综《思想验证区域》：是权力的游戏，还是民主的实验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67e4b06251d887b22925f732</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67e4b06251d887b22925f732</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Mar 2025 02:37:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>韩国综艺已经到了Next Level，居然连政治社会实验都拍成了生存战。《思想验证区域》就是这样一个综艺。皮蛋和果冻关于这个综艺很多要说的，那一起来听听我们关于这个综艺的到底有怎样的感（偏）想（见）吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：果冻 皮蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期： 皮蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show Notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">00:01:24</a> 思想验证区域到底是个什么综艺？嘉宾都是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">00:10:22</a> 游戏开始 ！-- 复杂的游戏设置和规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">00:28:56</a> 暗涌之下，高潮叠出，有结盟有分裂，也有淘汰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3312">00:55:12</a> 利益当前，人性是否能经得起考验？以囚徒困境游戏收尾，为整个综艺画上句号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4233">01:10:33</a> 政治和我们的生活息息相关，小小综艺蕴含了大量的政治学原理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5101">01:25:01</a> 你会在生活中谈论政治，女权等严肃又敏感的话题吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>Fall in Love – Alex Productions</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67466f2296634f588a6a74a0/lmppCmYQfzxedNunIYb2i_WrIuNL.m4a" length="94424220" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:37:18</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnV4qWcA3ZSN6PhgHQhQrgzjjrvm.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>13</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>12. 日剧《重版出来》：写给职场牛马的童话故事（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d55c8de924d4525acd8c3d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d55c8de924d4525acd8c3d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Mar 2025 11:12:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期《小声做梦》我们继续聊聊高分职场日剧《重版出来》的燃与泪，带大家深入解析「漫画编辑部的理想与现实」。你是否也为坚持梦想而挣扎过？或在职业瓶颈中寻找破局之道？下半场跟着我们从第七集看到大结局，解锁角色成长弧光与行业生态的细腻刻画！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期由于时长问题分为上下两集。上集地址：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d55686e924d4525acc9316?s=eyJ1IjogIjY1ZjUwNzZkZWRjZTY3MTA0YWNmZTQ0NSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d55686e924d4525acc9316?s=eyJ1IjogIjY1ZjUwNzZkZWRjZTY3MTA0YWNmZTQ0NSJ9"><span>日剧《重版出来》：写给职场牛马的童话故事！（上）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播：@果冻、@七七</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：@木木</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：@七七</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> EP7 大师兄20年的顿悟：放弃有时比坚持更需要勇气</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">04:20</a> 现实版继承者们的创作日常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="318">05:18</a> 不是治愈是致郁：人生是一场无人观看的漫才，但至少我曾经让自己大笑过</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">10:11</a> &nbsp;EP8 书籍铸就隐形翅膀，我们做漫画就是在贩卖梦想</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="919">15:19</a> 书店变形记：从知识圣殿到网红打卡生存指南</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1194">19:54</a> EP9 漫画家的囚徒困境：跳不出的小角公主魔咒</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> B太为何抗拒女性温柔关怀</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1669">27:49</a> EP10 三十年后重做新人：漫画老将的颠覆宣言</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 服装即语言：角色造型的视觉叙事密码</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> 真实感拍摄密码：真实旧刊与工厂取景的细节控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2187">36:27</a> 观众锐评，聊聊瑕不掩瑜中的瑕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2588">43:08</a> 漫画生死竞技：六作家争夺Jump席位的残酷物语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2713">45:13</a> 职场性别调查：女性创作者生存白皮书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2904">48:24</a> 在日剧职场童话里照见自己影子</span></p><span></span><p><span>正如剧中台词「想要长出隐形的翅膀就多读书吧，读得越多就越优美强韧，如此天下将任你翱翔」，愿每位听众都能在现实与理想的夹缝中，找到属于自己的飞翔姿态。欢迎在评论区分享你最爱的职场日剧，我们下期再见！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67466f2296634f588a6a74a0/ll_QVSPq0F1NcvLRw2ynESu3ZWgX.m4a" length="48267747" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnV4qWcA3ZSN6PhgHQhQrgzjjrvm.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>12</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
