  <item>
    <title>11. 日剧《重版出来》：写给职场牛马的童话故事（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d55686e924d4525acc9316</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d55686e924d4525acc9316</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Mar 2025 10:35:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期《小声做梦》带大家围观日式职场乌托邦！当现实中的我们被KPI追着跑，这部剧居然让编辑天天热血喊「重版出来」（加印警告）。从社畜焦虑到热血逆袭，我们一起拆解职场童话《重版出来》。你是否也被「开工决战」吓到灵魂出窍？或是厌倦职场无效内卷？这部豆瓣9.2分神剧带你看新人编辑用柔道精神摔碎潜规则，在纸片与梦想间杀出「重版」之路！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期由于时长原因分为上下两集。下期地址：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d55c8de924d4525acd8c3d?s=eyJ1IjogIjY1ZjUwNzZkZWRjZTY3MTA0YWNmZTQ0NSJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d55c8de924d4525acd8c3d?s=eyJ1IjogIjY1ZjUwNzZkZWRjZTY3MTA0YWNmZTQ0NSJ9"><span>日剧《重版出来》：写给职场牛马的童话故事（下）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>主播：@果冻、@七七</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：@木木</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：@七七</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> 职场童话启航｜《重版出来》的付出哲学</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 柔道选手变身漫画编辑的奇幻转行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="139">02:19</a> 松田奈绪子11年连载马拉松终迎结局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 豆瓣9.2神剧诞生记｜导演阵容强到跪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> 顶级卡司为何集体青睐冷门漫画？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> 二手书店奇遇：读者留言催生经典改编</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="503">08:23</a> </span><strong><span>EP1 &nbsp;权威的沉默！漫画家画风崩坏</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 面试现场过肩摔：史上最硬核职场破冰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> </span><strong><span>EP2 &nbsp;热血vs幽灵？编辑部与销售部の史诗级联动</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 职场黑魔法！那个记录多年秘密的黑色小本本</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1269">21:09</a> </span><strong><span>EP3 &nbsp;编辑的生存哲学——漫画家与读者间的救生圈</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1553">25:53</a> 跨次元彩蛋！《海贼王》作者竟成漫画角色原型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> </span><strong><span>EP4 &nbsp;新人的抉择：画工好vs故事好？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1938">32:18</a> 78岁新人漫画家震撼登场！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2320">38:40</a> </span><strong><span>EP5 &nbsp;小田切让の职场玄学：攒运气工作法</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2568">42:48</a> 一张彩票的奇幻漂流</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2763">46:03</a> 白色封面魔法：新书秒变爆款の奥秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2902">48:22</a> </span><strong><span>EP6 &nbsp;热血编辑黑化记：从理想主义到数字奴隶</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3398">56:38</a> 被压榨却闪耀的东江：漫画界小太阳</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【收听TIPS】</span></strong><br><span>新人必看：第一集女主摔翻社长的面试名场面，专治职场怂包症</span><br><span>打工人泪目：第五集社长「日行一善积运气」哲学，社畜生存指南+1</span><br><span>行业迷思：第六集安井的黑化与救赎，揭开「为爱发电」背后的残酷真相</span><br><span>梦幻联动：剧中漫画家原型暗藏《海贼王》尾田荣一郎、《死亡笔记》小畑健等彩蛋</span></p>]]></description>
