  <item>
    <title>8. 迷雾重重：西班牙悬疑电影不完全手册</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bc0e2005a90dfd0d76a453</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bc0e2005a90dfd0d76a453</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Feb 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当谜团浮现，真相是否如你所见？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这里，我们深入西班牙悬疑电影的迷雾之中，拆解每个精妙反转，探讨那些让人脊背发凉的故事。从经典名作到冷门佳片，带你感受西班牙电影独有的暗黑美学与悬疑魅力。</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有剧透恐惧，只有烧脑快感。一起入谜，解密未解之谜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：果冻 皮蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：果冻 皮蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">00:01:40</a> 关于西班牙电影、悬疑电影的崛起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="302">00:05:02</a> 第一部分，充满反转与复杂叙事结构的西班牙悬疑电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="337">00:05:37</a>《看不见的客人》：经典中的经典，反转中的反转</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">00:15:29</a>《海市蜃楼》：是悬疑还是科幻爱情电影？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1148">00:19:08</a>《黑暗面》：人性的复杂超越一切神秘超自然力量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1420">00:23:40</a> 第二部分，悬疑的外壳下，包裹着一颗温暖的心，关于家庭，关于爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">00:24:00</a>《孤堡惊情》：是什么样的电影让果冻在电影院看过后念念不忘？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1898">00:31:38</a>《马柔本宅秘事》：真相却是心碎又动人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2337">00:38:57</a>《朱莉亚的眼睛》：惊悚视听体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2792">00:46:32</a> 第三部分，与社会文化背景深刻交织的悬疑电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2792">00:46:32</a>《沼泽地》：充满粗粝厚重感的镜头语言，表达对社会的无力感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3276">00:54:36</a>《伤心小号曲》：极致暴力美学，充满政治隐喻的另类“悬疑”</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐</span></p><span></span><p><span>Silent Night (Dark Piano Version) – Myuu</span></p><span></span><p><span>Mystery – Gosoundtrack</span></p><span></span><p><span>Darkest Child – Kevin Macleod</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67466f2296634f588a6a74a0/ljt8Kzaxc-M9njoT_R__3Xyn14IW.m4a" length="57833880" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:35</itunes:duration>
