  <item>
    <title>2. 解锁入冬仪式感的N件小事，一起活得热气腾腾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677372ba1e823e72d31bd09c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677372ba1e823e72d31bd09c</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 05:26:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期《小声做梦》，我们将带领大家进入冬天的温暖梦境。在这里，皮蛋、果冻和七七将与你们一起探讨冬天的仪式感、分享特别记忆，以及那些让人又爱又恨的小麻烦。我们还会聊聊冬天的运动、影视和音乐，探讨这个季节的独特意义。在这个寒冷的季节里，让我们一起寻找属于自己的小幸福，感受冬天的多面性。准备好一杯热饮，加入我们的聊天，一起温暖这个冬天吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>皮蛋 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;果冻 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;七七</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：</span></p><span></span><p><span>七七</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownotes：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="63">00:01:03</a> 哪一刻你觉得冬天来了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">00:05:05</a> 圣诞季的巅峰时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">00:08:08</a> 圣诞树的节日魅力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">00:10:30</a> 理想的冬日场景是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">00:12:06</a> 怀旧围炉取暖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">00:19:34</a> 南方人的抗冻绝招</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1334">00:22:14</a> 北海道流冰奇遇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">00:26:53</a> 俄罗斯小镇极寒体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1805">00:30:05</a> 芝加哥严寒与冰冻瀑布</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2039">00:33:59</a> 英国圣歌「KTV」体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">00:38:06</a> 为演唱会的极限旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2618">00:43:38</a> 车站里的天使manager大叔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2709">00:45:09</a> 北方初体验之三明治穿法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2902">00:48:22</a> 滑雪到底什么时候会骨折</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3107">00:51:47</a> 冬日里的热瑜伽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3491">00:58:11</a> 冬日观影《情书》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3695">01:01:35</a> 牛姐圣诞小曲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3880">01:04:40</a> 日剧里的冬日元素</span></p>]]></description>
